Cell["\<\
At a raw size the vertex count picks the style. Grids of 10 \[Times] 10, 20 \
\[Times] 20 and 35 \[Times] 35, with 96, 396 and 1221 vertices, take the \
vertex sizes of the small, medium and large style:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"5c392f5f-9e62-4ee7-be3b-55d6186f14b2"],

